flowchart LR
  STR[Candidate action] --> AG{{GO / NOGO / HOLD}}
  POL[(risk · cost · policy<br/>failure history · authorization)] --> AG
  AG -- GO --> EXE[Executor]
  AG -- NOGO --> BLK[blocked + logged]
  AG -- HOLD --> REV[additional review / human authorization]
  EXE --> LOG[(decision + outcome log)]
  BLK --> LOG
